/Title (A final evidence-based conclusion cannot be stated until the experiment has been executed and the pending result tables and graphs have been completed. After measurement, the conclusion should identify the best- performing configuration for the tested workload, explain the observed trade-offs, state whether the hypotheses were supported, and describe the conditions under which the result may change.)
