1454 0 obj
<<
/Title (A multi-core processor can execute work on more than one core at the same time. The OS scheduler selects which runnable task executes on each available logical CPU. Overall performance depends not only on the number of cores, but also on task placement, workload balance, synchronization overhead and the amount of parallel work available.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1442 0 R
>>
endobj
1455 0 obj
<<
