<<
/Title (The investigation does not claim that affinity and load balancing have never been studied together. Its contribution is a small, controlled and reproducible Python-plus-Linux experiment that varies affinity and distribution while keeping the workload and machine constant. This makes it possible to observe their combined effect in a practical student-level prototype.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1447 0 R
>>
